tradition, it's fine.

c0987
01:09:21.380 --> 01:09:23.360
They have a right to a national memory.

c0988
01:09:23.620 --> 01:09:24.000
Right.

c0989
01:09:25.040 --> 01:09:27.060
What about our national memory?

c0990
01:09:28.160 --> 01:09:29.060
I remember,

c0991
01:09:29.300 --> 01:09:31.420
and I don't say this to criticize,

c0992
