but

c0993
01:09:32.440 --> 01:09:35.540
you know, in Israel,

c0994
01:09:35.540 --> 01:09:39.080
the secular Israeli is not like a secular American.

c0995
01:09:39.660 --> 01:09:40.720
Secular American is American.

c0996
01:09:41.100 --> 01:09:43.120
He's not religious, but he respects religion.

c0997
01:09:43.300 --> 01:09:44.040
He loves religion.

c0998
01:09:44.460 --> 01:09:49.620
Secular Israeli is somebody who respects religion,

c0999
01:09:49.780 --> 01:09:51.480
everybody's religion except the Jewish religion.

c1000
01:09:51.620 --> 01:09:52.480
It's anti-Jewish religion.

c1001
01:09:54.740 --> 01:09:58.440
And, you know, except the Jewish religion.

c1002
01:09:59.820 --> 01:10:01.660
I saw a fantastic thing in the program,

c1003
01:10:02.080 --> 01:10:03.320
and nobody caught it.

c1004
